                <pb facs="0342" n="258" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg258"/>

                <head>No. 107.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Beach</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-05-15"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 15,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Flores has telegraphed permission for Santos to come to United States. You will
                    assist his departure.</p>
                <closer><signed>BAYARD.</signed></closer>
            </div>
